  "details": "With \"Only Show Friend Join/Leave/Portal Notifications\" disabled, the HUD incorrectly uses the friend icon for all user notifications. When this setting is off, non friends should have a generic user icon rather than the friend icon.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\nGo to settings and toggle \"Only Show Friend Join/Leave/Portal Notifications\" off.\n\nStay in a public or crowded instance.\n\nWait for someone to join, leave, or drop a portal.\n\n????\n\nProfit.",
